# NEMESIS tooling — discretionary instant use

Do **not** wait for the user to ask for tool/skill/MCP calls on this project. Pick the best asset for the moment from the map below and use it proactively.

Canonical inventory: workspace canvas `tooling-for-green-paper.canvas.tsx` (and the 2026-07-23 tooling report that produced it).

## Venue fact

NEMESIS trades **Kalshi** event contracts (paper-first). **Not** Kraken/crypto-spot execution.

## Must use when the moment matches

| Moment | Use |
|--------|-----|
| Any code/ops/relaunch/paper diagnosis | `.cursor/skills/nemesis-ops/SKILL.md` |
| Zero/few paper trades; funnel stalls | `.cursor/skills/diagnose-qualification-funnel/SKILL.md` |
| Post-overnight / go-no-go | `nemesis/docs/HANDOFF-NEXT-SESSION.md` + post-cutoff filters only |
| About to claim green / fixed / passing | `verification-before-completion` |
| Trade path / books / feeds | In-repo `@nemesis/connectors` (Kalshi WS/REST/book) — never relax exchange-origin |

## Use when relevant

- After first certified trades / release audit → `audit-nemesis`
- Invalid run or unexplained regression → `systematic-debugging`
- Crypto allowlist / Crypto Lead → Binance connector (signal only)
- GEA visibility → bridge + brain-core (already wired)

## Later only

- Subtext → UI proof screenshots **after** trades exist
- parallel-web-search → no-go pivot / external research
- shadcn / browser MCP → polish or web only (Electron ≠ URL)

## Never for green-paper path

- Kraken CLI MCP / Kraken recipes (wrong venue)
- Appwrite (local AppData JSON is source of truth)
- Higgsfield (irrelevant)
- Lowering profit / exchange-origin bars to manufacture green P&L

## Hard habits

1. Filter validation logs strictly **after** relaunch cutoff before judging a fix.
2. Prefer AppData JSONL ground truth over guessing UI state.
3. User does not need to request these tools — invoke at discretion.
